  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#figure-note-about-references\r\n\r\n> The first figcaption element child of the element, if any, represents the caption of the figure element's contents\\. If there is no child figcaption element, then there is no caption\\.\r\n\r\nI think that \"The first figcaption element\" should be changed to \"The first or last figcaption element\". \r\n\r\nThank you.",
